=== COMPILER2 DIAGNOSTICS ===
  [hir] E0010

  × LLM function `Greet` uses a Jinja `#"..."#` prompt, which is no longer supported. Use a backtick prompt with `${...}` interpolation instead.
   ╭─[main.baml:3:12]
 3 │     prompt #"Hello {{ name }}"#
   ·            ──────────┬─────────
   ·                      ╰── replace `#"Hello {{ name }}"#` with `` `Hello ${name}` ``
   ╰────
